10	 * owner's {@code namesakeCount} is 0, then is capped at 3. (Level 4 is reserved for tenure.)
11	 *
12	 * <p>Runs in the {@code POST /api/owners} pipeline after {@link CountOwnerNamesakes} (so
13	 * {@code namesakeCount} is already frozen) and before {@link SaveOwner} (so the value is persisted)
